# Pairs with ReadPositionHonest. The activation ignores the leaf row's record of
# held snapshot coverage and starts cold over a vanished snapshot. The base fails
# such an activation closed (issue #4634).
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestVanishedSnapshotStartsCold
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation ignores the record and starts cold over a vanished snapshot
PERTURBS: Activate

--- FIND
    /\ ~stale[l]
    /\ ~SnapshotVanished(l)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the record is not consulted.
    /\ ~stale[l]
--- END
--- FIND
SnapshotLoss == FALSE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the environment may destroy a snapshot.
SnapshotLoss == TRUE
--- END

--- FIND
MaxFaults == 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the snapshot vanishes and its leaf stops: two faults.
MaxFaults == 2
--- END